# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Utfier skriuwe: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: ([''] tccompare: ['']), nije-rigel.
